WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.692
On a results page: Batch, then Pre-screen. It reads just the cards; low pay shows red.

2
00:00:05.692 --> 00:00:09.372
Untick the ones you don't want; open the rest as tabs.

3
00:00:09.372 --> 00:00:14.368
Click Scan tabs. This is the background analysis; the icon shows progress.

4
00:00:14.368 --> 00:00:16.892
Open the popup; the results are all here.

5
00:00:16.892 --> 00:00:21.336
A page it couldn't read gets no score; open it on its own and analyze again.
